        "original_id": "9e2f2e67-2964-5fe4-9114-c773cd087cc6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom, Amber, Katherine Parkinson, Sally, Steve, Justin Edwards, Simon Blackwell, Jesse Armstrong, Sam Bain\n- TV series: The Old Guys, The IT Crowd, The Thick of It, In The Loop, Veep, Peep Show, Four Lions, Back\n- Organizations: Channel 4, British Comedy Awards, BAFTA\n\nFacts:\n- In The Old Guys, baby boomer Tom has little in life except his daughter Amber.\n- In The Old Guys, Amber is played by Katherine Parkinson.\n- In The Old Guys, Amber is dating Sally's son Steve.\n- In The Old Guys, Steve is played by Justin Edwards.\n- Simon Blackwell is best known for work on The Thick of It, In The Loop, and Veep.\n- Simon Blackwell collaborated with Jesse Armstrong and Sam Bain on Peep Show, Four Lions, and The Old Guys.\n- Katherine Parkinson appeared in several comedy series, including The IT Crowd on Channel 4 as Jen Barber.\n- Katherine Parkinson won the British Comedy Best TV Actress Award in 2009 for The IT Crowd.\n- Katherine Parkinson received a BAFTA TV Award nomination in 2011 for The IT Crowd.\n- Katherine Parkinson won a BAFTA TV Award in 2014 for The IT Crowd.\n- Back is a six-part TV series created by Simon Blackwell.\n- Back premiered on Channel 4 on 6 September 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
